@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
title Watermark++ — RPC observation → processing proxy → overlay family (v1.5.0)

start
:boot on gemini.google.com (host-gated);
:NetHook arm (kernel realm slot, shared wrap);

partition "asset discovery" {
  :batchexecute RPC observer (NetHook onTraffic);
  :image candidates discovered (discoveredUrls sets —
  call-scoped per scan, cache census class);
  :history draft blocks collected (responseEntriesByDraftId,
  per-parse local);
}

:image session store;
note right
  v1.5.0 (B.1): createImageSessionStore
  sessions Map is FIFO-capped at 16
  (factory-escaped registry — the
  cache census's negative-proven
  defect class on v1.4.10).
  Element bindings ride WeakMaps.
end note

if (watermark detected (alpha-map engine)?) then (yes)
  :decodedAlphaMaps cache (bounded);
  :gradient + variance scoring;
  :size-adjusted confidence (scale list);
  :preview-neighborhood priors per radius;
  :batchexecute processing request
  (intent-gated, gmFetch-bound);
  if (processed asset returns?) then (yes)
    :original URL registry (for restore);
    :overlay / download / clipboard action;
  else (no)
    :typed error path — retry bounded;
  endif
else (no)
  :observer keeps scanning;
endif

partition "processing proxy" {
  :intent-gated fetch rewriter (async
  fetch→process→synthetic Response);
  note right
    Ledgered page-realm interposition
    (sink census fetchWrap class +
    global census ledger) — beyond the
    hub's synchronous verdict scope.
  end note
}

stop

note bottom
  SIZE-AUDIT (G6): 1.28 MB of pure code mass —
  zero blob/font payload; externalization rejected
  (OPSEC posture); record under
  documentation/watermark/SIZE-AUDIT.md.
end note
@enduml
